          "reason": "Adapt the bubble wrap model for a tactile single-player ASMR experience. Remove the malicious TypeConfig backdoor loader and legacy physical RegenButton. Replace individual bubble scripts with debounced physical squash animations, synchronous audio playback, and server counting integration. Add dedicated server state management and a clean desktop/touch HUD with live counter, completion fanfare, and sheet reset.",
